tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262840/extras/042cd8a29b2ec28b892e95b9c478fc9c.avif?t=1781171654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262840/extras_big/042cd8a29b2ec28b892e95b9c478fc9c.webp?t=1781171654 width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262840/extras/4bc3c92032b48ce6a6125f483f979246.poster.avif?t=1781171654\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262840/extras/4bc3c92032b48ce6a6125f483f979246.webm?t=1781171654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>The Mimics and Creeps are passive enemies that will appear while you’re on your shift.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- MIMICS - </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Mimics imitate everyday objects, but they are not perfect.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Remove them quickly or your shift will be cut short if too many appear.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- CREEPS -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Creeps are humanoid creatures that will cut your shift short</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>if you don’t remove them from the building immediately.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_